              description: "Controls whether this field appears in tooltips and ARIA descriptions generated from the encoding (e.g., when the mark definition's `tooltip` property is `true`).\n\n__Default value:__ `true`\n\n__See also:__ [`tooltip`](https://vega.github.io/vega-lite/docs/tooltip.html#encoding) documentation.",
              type: "boolean"
