          description: "- For arc marks, the arc length in radians if theta2 is not specified, otherwise the start arc angle. (A value of 0 indicates up or \u201Cnorth\u201D, increasing values proceed clockwise.)\n\n- For text marks, polar coordinate angle in radians.",
